# A real Flash video player with a corpus clip (cavekit-flash.md R8, T-578): MediaElement playing H.264 (MP4), 10 s, by autoplay. The
# player reports nothing to the page, so the checks are the screen's and the sink's: the picture drawn and moving while it
# plays, still once the clip's length has gone by (the player at its end), drawn at the end, the plugin alive.
id: flash-video-mediaelement
section: Flash
item: MediaElement plays a H.264 (MP4) clip to its end: the picture drawn and moving while it plays, still at the clip's end, the plugin alive
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8097/title/bbb-h264-360
kit: cavekit-flash.md R8
wait rect m 40
wait content m 30
expect decoder ok
expect flash-rate m 5 5 40
expect flash-drawn m yes
wait still m 40
expect flash-drawn m yes
expect plugin 3 alive
